    <briefdescription>
<para>A simple target adapter that splits incoming requests into AV and PV requests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This adapter can be used to connect a TLM2_PV_AV initiator to a TLM2_AV and/or TLM2_PV target. It splits incoming requests into AV and PV requests based on the access type (blocking/non-blocking).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>BUSWIDTH</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The width of the data bus in bits. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
